      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "V1 dependencies are captured with Effect.serviceOption so read-only consumers work without any V1 layer; the V1/V2 branded model-ID mismatch is centralized in the v2ModelToV1Session/v2ModelToV1Prompt cast helpers, and subagent results are posted back to the parent as Synthetic events rather than returned."
